# source at ir.html lines 127, 129, 130, 301 and 316; keepfile-check exit 0, 17
# checks.
# 
# NOTHING WRITES THE PICKED FILE, which is 043's standing requirement, checked in
# the code rather than assumed: keepCurrentAsFile passes currentFile.bytes
# straight into writeKeepFile, which hands it to writeZip as data and copies
# nothing back; openKeepFile reads a fresh buffer. keepfile-check compares
# against an independent snapshot taken before the call rather than against the
# input array, so the instrument is sound.
# 
# src/keepfile.ts and tools/keepfile-check.mjs are byte-identical to 3cc78ef --
# untouched by this commit. No unstaged or untracked strays.
